{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgb2UnnuGnDQHwbtYNTva","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The result is the same as the last run, and there's nothing more I can do in the code. `./check.sh` still fails on one scenario, `get_registers_ghost` (R10). The other eight scenarios pass.\n\nR10 asks `GetItem` to write a \"ghost\" row on a miss. R9 asks `GetItem` to leave the shelf unchanged. Both can't hold. The checker also reports that no implementation could satisfy the R10 scenario (\"correct the scenario, not the code\"). I'm keeping R9, which passes. Making the R10 scenario pass would break R9.\n\nTo get a green gate, the spec needs to change in Lattice Studio. Either remove R10 and `get_registers_ghost`, or remove R9 and `get_missing_stores_nothing` and I'll add the ghost write. I can't edit the spec files myself. Tell me which rule should win."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":882,"cache_read_input_tokens":19051,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":882},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6a32bdce-764f-4126-a86a-b985cf6fb8c7","uuid":"934038b7-5647-4b38-8e6a-6d63d1f17fad","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:29:31.759Z","request_id":"req_011Cgb2UncV7ctRKxbdNFLh6"}
